Future Derived Objectives

Future context-interpretation objectives shall maintain direct traceability to SO-F-003.

Potential areas include:

- Context Construction
- Observation Relationship Analysis
- Situation Interpretation
- Context Change Detection
- Interpretation Confidence

These are architectural candidates and are not yet approved objectives.

