Downstream Traceability

The interpreted operating context produced by SO-F-003 is expected to provide traceable input to downstream decision-generation capabilities, including SO-F-004.

---

Traceability Notes

All engineering artifacts implementing operating-context interpretation shall maintain traceability to SO-F-003, either directly or through approved child objectives.

Future decision-generation artifacts shall be capable of tracing their contextual inputs back through SO-F-003 and, where applicable, to the observations originating from SO-F-002.

This preserves an engineering lineage from observed conditions through interpretation toward adaptive decision-making.
